  The deploy service is not set up yet. It rolls out and updates your stacks and
  runs as its own system user, apart from the host service, with access to      
  Docker. D sets it up; on the command line: sudo qhost deploy-service setup    
                                                                                
  Setting up needs root: quit and run sudo qhost.                               
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
